ity, changed boot identity, updated running kernel, recovered services, zero failed units, and intact inventory were directly observed. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The intermediate `updateinfo list --security --available` check counted older advisory entries and exited unsuccessfully, creating an apparent inconsistency; the later package-aware `check-update --security` check directly reported no pending updates. This modestly reduces confidence but does not outweigh the final state evidence (cmd-e152a2e00a5d4cb9, cmd-3e9885d502734043).","The final lifecycle snapshot inventories `/tmp`, not `/var/tmp`, so the final existence of the update log and completion-marker files created by cmd-e1799befac8a4d0a was not directly checked."]}
